sentences.t:
At domus interior gemitu miseroque tumultu
miscetur, penitusque cavae plangoribus aedes
femineis ululant;

sentences.l:
But the house within, with groan and wretched uproar,
is confounded, and deep inside the hollow halls with lamentations
womanly howl;

sentences.t:
Quinquaginta illi thalami, spes tanta nepotum,
barbarico postes auro spoliisque superbi,
procubuere;

sentences.l:
Fifty those bedchambers, so great hope of grandsons,
the doorposts with barbarian gold and spoils proud,
have fallen;

